release/
# NOTE: `dist/` is intentionally NOT ignored at the repo root.
# internal/interface/webui/embed/dist/ holds the Vite SPA bundle that is
# pulled into the Go binary via `//go:embed all:embed/dist`. Keeping the
# directory tracked in git means `go test`, `golangci-lint` and the
# production binary can typecheck without first running `npm run build`.
# Local per-developer scratch output should use `web/dist/` instead.
out/
build/
web/dist/

